Just wanted to say thanks for pointing out that subtle bug in our caching mechanism! The recent OAuth merge included some changes to abort() to add additional info: https://github.com/reddit/reddit/blob/master/r2/r2/lib/base.py#L66
Instead of creating Yet Another Abort With Error Message (I'm pretty sure we have two now), is it possible to just log the error instead?
Hope that helps! }
